@startuml 题目1-图书馆借还书类图
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #333333
  ArrowColor #333333
}

class Student {
  - studentId: String
  - name: String
  - major: String
  - grade: int
  - borrowedBooks: List<Book>
  - maxBorrowCount: int = 5
  - fine: double
  __
  + canBorrow(): bool
  + borrowBook(book: Book): bool
  + returnBook(book: Book): bool
  + queryBorrowed(): List<Book>
  + payFine(amount: double): void
}

class Book {
  - isbn: String
  - title: String
  - author: String
  - publisher: String
  - status: BookStatus
  - dueDate: Date
  - callNumber: String
  __
  + getStatus(): BookStatus
  + markBorrowed(dueDate: Date): void
  + markReturned(): void
  + getDueDate(): Date
}

enum BookStatus {
  IN_LIBRARY
  BORROWED
  RESERVED
}

class Librarian {
  - staffId: String
  - name: String
  - department: String
  __
  + handleBorrow(student: Student, book: Book): bool
  + handleReturn(student: Student, book: Book): double
  + addNewBook(book: Book): void
  + removeBook(book: Book): void
  + remindOverdue(): void
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Book : 借阅 >
Librarian ..> Student : 借还资格审核 >
Librarian ..> Book : 借还/出入库操作 >
Book ..> BookStatus : 状态 >

note right of Librarian
  封装：书籍状态与学生借阅列表
  只能由管理员(系统)方法修改
end note
@enduml
